Package: strawwu-session
Version: __VERSION__
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-session-bin, gnome-session-common, gnome-settings-daemon (>= 3.37.0), strawwu-shell, xwayland, session-migration
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Provides: x-session-manager
Description: StrawWU desktop session
 Registers the StrawWU session for GDM and launches strawwu-shell
 (GNOME Shell fork profile with built-in dock). Hub autostart is
 enabled when the Hub package is present.
